(text "GPIO map (Rev C review of Rev B): IO0 I2C_SDA, IO2 I2C_SCL (strap: 4.7k pull-up keeps it high at reset), IO3 BUTTON," (exclude_from_sim no) (at 35.56 222.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a98a3e3b-0fd8-4670-97d8-87a3eb17c553"))
(text "IO1 IMU_INT1, IO4/5/6 SPI SCK/MISO/MOSI, IO7 CS_ADC, IO10 CS_IMU, IO20 LED_R, IO21 LED_G, IO18/19 USB (service only)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 35.56 224.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "88be7440-3532-4f7f-b9f3-614d988c99e2"))
(text "IO9 = BOOT strap (10k pull-up, pulled low only by the service jig). IO8 = strap pull-up, otherwise a spare pin." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 35.56 226.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "77b107ed-fa5d-4f6f-8429-90aabefc102e"))
(text "IO21 is U0TXD: the ROM boot log will flicker the green emitter at reset. Accepted for the prototype; firmware logs via USB." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 35.56 228.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ddeff47b-9313-4097-9fe1-706f7bc33b19"))
(text "J3 pin 1 is sense-only for the jig. The jig must NOT back-feed +3V3 into the regulator output; power from the cartridge." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 35.56 230.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3e430655-c203-4dca-9609-db52be82faed"))
(text "J3 sits on the board underside and is reached through the empty cartridge bay. It has no charging function." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 35.56 233.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "703c9fed-40ec-45d7-86d5-21cff33bd40d"))
(text "02  12-BIT ADC + INERTIAL SENSOR (SHARED SPI)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 250.19 28 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a0039814-1486-4fd1-b9d8-ffc57ae3b2bf"))
