(text "Dropout check: TLV755P max dropout 238 mV at 500 mA (datasheet); scale roughly with load. ESP-NOW/Wi-Fi TX bursts can" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 250.19 236.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "dbbe5baf-d38a-4407-bf8e-782838c29ce4"))
(text "reach a few hundred mA, so cell IR + contact resistance + dropout set the usable cut-off. Firmware must stop recording" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 250.19 238.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "27ecc308-2676-4fce-9248-943f0550b0d3"))
(text "at a gauge-reported threshold set from measured sag (bench item P1). C6 input, C7/C8 + C2/C3 output bulk." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 250.19 240.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1e13ebba-d22d-47cc-a729-b060aacfbf50"))
(text "J2: 2 x VBAT + 2 x GND spring contacts land on pads on the cartridge lid. Cell protection (e.g. BQ2970) lives in" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 250.19 242.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ee40d171-85c9-4bd3-bd7b-38bfc25e5686"))
(text "the cartridge; charging, NTC and pack ID belong to the separate dock (not designed here)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 250.19 244.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "cc7f167a-8a5a-407b-9097-e5af40957c77"))
