(text "Force channel: FSR from VEXC to Fn_RAW, 10k to GND, 3.3k + 1 uF low-pass (fc = 48 Hz) to the ADC. The 1 uF reservoir" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 39.37 400.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6df297ba-be39-4916-9915-2629bb9699ff"))
(text "is ~50,000x the MCP3208 sample capacitor, so acquisition settling is set by the RC, not the ADC source-impedance limit." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 39.37 402.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4401c013-9848-4a38-901c-14c9cc3318ac"))
(text "Excitation is continuous (Rev B decision kept): switching it every 5 ms cannot settle a 3.3 ms RC. R33 limits a tail short" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 39.37 404.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "43fc3bf9-597e-4952-bcd0-0af061620d1f"))
(text "to ~150 mA so the 3V3 rail survives; VEXC is sensed after R33 (Rev B sensed +3V3, which could not detect this fault)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 39.37 406.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b8f65263-973e-4f84-98ae-2a93949b994d"))
(text "ESD at J1: every force/ID line reaches the ADC through 3.3k into a 1 uF reservoir (8 kV HBM = 0.8 uC -> ~0.8 V step)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 39.37 408.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "afaebe40-79ef-48ad-a164-757bf87a5c46"))
(text "No TVS is fitted; the RC networks are the protection. System-level IEC 61000-4-2 testing is still required." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 39.37 411.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "af17dff7-5f5b-4210-b495-7419846f239e"))
(text "Divider output is NOT the Tekscan A201 op-amp reference circuit and does not inherit its linearity or drift figures." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 39.37 413.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f7529200-c44a-44e8-9820-580e61220ac2")) (embedded_fonts no))